@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-05 Manage Cake Design

|Customer|
start
:Select "Design" from the navigation bar\nand open Cake Designer page;
:Enter design preferences\n(text, flavor, size, colors, occasion, etc.);
:Submit design request and wait for preview;

|AI System|
:Receive input and check that\nrequired parameters are complete;

if (Input complete & parameters valid?) then (Yes)
  :Generate visual preview images\nof the custom cake;
  :Display generated preview(s) to customer;

  |Customer|
  :Review generated cake design preview(s);

  if (Customer action?) then (Ask Question via Chatbot)
    |Customer|
    :Use AI Chatbot to ask clarifying question\nabout a design option or term;

    |AI System|
    :Minimize/close chatbot window\nand keep customer on design page;

  else if (Request Changes / Adjustments)
    |Customer|
    :Request design adjustments\n(e.g., color, decorations, size/tier);

    |AI System|
    :Regenerate updated preview(s);
    :Display updated preview(s) to customer;

  else (Save & Order Design)
    |Customer|
    :Select and order the final preferred design\n("Add to Cart" / "Order This Design");

    |System|
    :Notify Staff/Admin that a new\ncustom design is ready for review;

    |Staff/Admin|
    :Review saved design against ingredient\navailability and preparation feasibility;

    |System|
    if (Design feasible / approved?) then (Yes)
      :Update design status to "Approved";
      :Attach finalized design to new order\n(Manage Order);
    else (No - Declined)
      :Update design status to\n"Declined - Design Not Possible";
      :Send notification to customer with notes\non why design cannot be made;
      
      |Customer|
      :Prompt to submit alternative or\nsimplified design request;
    endif
  endif

else (No - Incomplete / Unavailable)
  |AI System|
  :Prompt for clarification or suggest\navailable alternatives;

  |Customer|
  :Correct input or select alternative;
endif

|System|
stop
@enduml
